                "text": "What kind of music do you listen to?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t3-s-q1-t6.mp3",
                  "seconds": 3
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t7",
                "text": "What type of animals do you like?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t3-s-q1-t7.mp3",
                  "seconds": 2.8
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t8",
                "text": "Do you like shopping? (Why?/Why not?)",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t3-s-q1-t8.mp3",
