            "turns": [
              {
                "id": "t1",
                "text": "Now I’d like each of you to talk on your own about something. I’m going to give each of you a photograph and I’d like you to talk about it. A, here is your photograph. It shows people watching television. Please tell us what you can see in the photograph.",
                "audio": {
