    {
      "id": "s3",
      "part": 3,
      "label": "Part 3",
      "instruction": "Talk together with your partner about the situation.",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "q3",
          "number": 3,
          "points": 20,
          "skills": [],
          "material": [
            {
              "id": "i2",
              "type": "imageRef",
              "image": "img2"
            }
          ],
          "interaction": {
            "kind": "speaking",
            "prompt": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "Talk with your partner about the different places to celebrate a girl’s birthday with all the students in her class, and decide which would be best for a large group of people."
              }
            ],
            "turns": [
              {
                "id": "t1",
                "text": "Now, in this part of the test you’re going to talk about something together for about two minutes. I’m going to describe a situation to you. A girl wants to go somewhere to celebrate her birthday. She wants to invite all the students in her class. Here are some places they could celebrate together. Talk together about the different places to celebrate the girl’s birthday and say which would be best for a large group of people. All right? Now, talk together.",
                "role": "examiner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t3-s-q3-t1.mp3",
                  "seconds": 32.2
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t2",
                "text": "Shall I start? I think a party room is a good idea, because there is lots of space for dancing. What do you think?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t3-s-q3-t2.mp3",
                  "seconds": 7.4
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t3",
                "text": "That’s true. What about a barbecue in the garden? It’s fun, but maybe the garden isn’t big enough for the whole class. Do you agree?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t3-s-q3-t3.mp3",
                  "seconds": 8.9
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t4",
                "text": "I’m not sure about the restaurant. It could be quite expensive for so many people. What’s your opinion?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t3-s-q3-t4.mp3",
                  "seconds": 6.6
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t5",
                "text": "What about the swimming pool or a picnic in the park? Which one do you think is better?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t3-s-q3-t5.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.3
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t6",
                "text": "But if it rains, the picnic will be terrible! And not everyone likes swimming. Don’t you think so?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t3-s-q3-t6.mp3",
                  "seconds": 6.4
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t7",
                "text": "So, which place do you think would be best for a big group? I think the party room, because everyone can dance together.",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t3-s-q3-t7.mp3",
                  "seconds": 7.5
                }
              }
            ],
            "maxSeconds": 45,
            "scoring": "judge"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
